      "System.Description": "<p>Checkout is English-only, EUR-only, and offers cards and PayPal only. The shop already ships to several EU markets, but checkout has not followed the international expansion. Sales wants five additional markets live this year, and support reports that non-English tickets already take days to resolve. </p><p>Finance has no position on display currencies and FX pricing, and there is no single owner for international checkout. The scope is not defined: markets, languages, currencies, and local payment methods are all open. </p>",
